ange the way OneBit Adventure looks completely with unlockable themes that makes the game fit to your liking.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1688320/extras/7a0b7574e20be8f9d95712b8cd0a5dbd.avif?t=1661136776\" /></div><br>If you love 8-bit roguelikes and are looking for something casual to play, then you should consider OneBit Adventure right now. It's meant to be a simply fun experience where you can level up, play around with different combinations of weapons and skills to reach the furthest. It's a relaxing game, but also has leaderboards to compete with other OneBit players around the world!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2>\u2022 Infinite world generation with 4+ unique dungeons<br><br>\u2022 6+ bosses to battle<br>\u2022 7+ classes with unique character builds at level 15<br>\u2022 30+ unique equipment to use<br>\u2022 40+ monsters to battle<br>\u2022 Competitive worldwide leaderboard with premium rewards<br>\u2022 Cross platform with Android, iOS, and Steam<br>\u2022 Hardcore mode for true roguelike experience",
